[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:131. Don't Be So Sure]
[00:01.380] Lesson 131. | 第131课。
[00:04.670] Where are you going to spend your holidays this year, Harry? | 哈里，今年你打算去哪里度假？
[00:09.865] We may go abroad. I'm not sure. | 我们可能会出国，我不确定。
[00:13.045] My wife wants to go to Egypt. | 我妻子想去埃及。
[00:15.925] I'd like to go there too. | 我也想去那里。
[00:18.725] We can't make up our minds. | 我们还没下定决心。
[00:21.720] Will you travel by sea or by air? | 你们会坐船还是坐飞机旅行？
[00:25.185] We may travel by sea. | 我们可能会坐船旅行。
[00:27.355] It's cheaper, isn't it? | 这样更便宜，不是吗？
[00:29.595] It may be cheaper, | 也许是更便宜，
[00:31.600] but it takes a long time. | 但那需要很长时间。
[00:34.105] I'm sure you will enjoy yourselves. | 我相信你们会玩得开心的。
[00:37.185] Don't be so sure. | 别那么肯定。
[00:39.155] We may not go anywhere. | 我们可能哪里都不会去。
[00:41.990] My wife always worries too much. | 我妻子总是操心太多。
[00:44.755] Who's going to look after the dog? | 谁来照顾狗？
[00:47.245] Who's going to look after the house? | 谁来照顾房子？
[00:49.965] Who's going to look after the garden? | 谁来照顾花园？
[00:52.915] We have this problem every year. | 我们每年都会遇到这个问题。
[00:56.100] In the end, we stay at home | 结果呢，我们呆在家里，
[00:58.755] and look after everything. | 照顾所有的事情。